      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A HOOLIGAN (1) is a promising type who notched his 4th career success when too good (22.49) at this track last time. Has never been out of the money in six starts this course and distance. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Well placed and can measure up. ESTRADA (2) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (22.77) at this track over 400m. Will give a great sight again. AGASSI (6) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 22.60 beating Cliff The Boss. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. DODGY SHADOW (4) is always a threat when she races at this journey.",
